==Trivia==
The illustration rare print of this card features a [[surfing Pikachu]] in the background.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Lapras|56}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Lapras}}.
*{{m|Hydro Pump}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Lapras}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

